    "title": "Gallipolis police asking for assistance in finding 3 missing Gallia County teens - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ANTHONY DAMCOTT ,\n1 hours ago GALLIPOLIS, Ohio (WCHS) — A police department in Gallia County, Ohio, says it is asking for assistance in locating three missing teenagers. The teens went missing from the Safe Opportunity Foster Alliance facility on Holly Lane in the area of the Gallipolis Developmental Center, according to a social media post from the Gallipolis Police Department. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
